# Options every run shares. Robot reads one option per line; "#" lines are comments.
# Use:  robot -A args/common.args tests      (or with pabot, see README)

# All output (output.xml, log.html, report.html, screenshots) in one ignored folder.
--outputdir results
# Report title and suite name instead of the folder name "Tests".
--name Robot Framework Automation
--reporttitle Robot Framework Automation Report
--logtitle Robot Framework Automation Log
# Tag descriptions shown in report.html (statistics by tag). In an argument file
# everything after the first space is the value, so no quoting is needed.
--tagdoc smoke:Fast checks of the main flows
--tagdoc negative:Wrong input must be rejected
--tagdoc e2e:A whole user journey
